<!DOCTYPE html><html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Aravind Portfolio | Software Engineer</title><.profile-photo {
    width: 180px;
    height: 180px;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: 4px solid #d4af37;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.6);
    margin: 25px 0;
}>
* {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

html {
    scroll-behavior: smooth;
}

body {
    background: #080808;
    color: #f5f5f5;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    line-height: 1.7;
}

:root {
    --gold: #d4af37;
    --light-gold: #ffe69a;
    --panel: #151515;
}

header {
    padding: 20px 7%;
    background: #101010;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #55451b;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 15px;
}

.logo {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 23px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

nav {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 14px;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: var(--gold);
}

.hero {
    min-height: 85vh;
    padding: 70px 20px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    background:
        radial-gradient(ellipse at top, #30240a, transparent 60%),
        #080808;
}

.badge {
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
    color: var(--light-gold);
    padding: 8px 18px;
    border-radius: 30px;
    font-size: 13px;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(36px, 8vw, 65px);
    margin: 22px 0 12px;
    line-height: 1.2;
}

.hero h1 span {
    color: var(--gold);
}

.hero h2 {
    color: #ddd;
    font-size: clamp(18px, 4vw, 25px);
    font-weight: normal;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
}

.hero p {
    color: #bbb;
    max-width: 550px;
    margin-bottom: 28px;
}

.button {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 23px;
    margin: 5px;
    background: var(--gold);
    color: #080808;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    border-radius: 5px;
}

.button:hover {
    background: var(--light-gold);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
}

.button.secondary {
    color: var(--gold);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--gold);
}

section {
    padding: 65px 7%;
    max-width: 1100px;
    margin: auto;
}

section h2 {
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 30px;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
}

.card {
    background: var(--panel);
    padding: 24px;
    border: 1px solid #3a321e;
    border-radius: 12px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
}

.card h3 {
    color: var(--light-gold);
    margin-bottom: 10px;
}

.card p {
    color: #c4c4c4;
}

.skills, .projects {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(
        auto-fit, minmax(140px, 1fr)
    );
    gap: 15px;
}

.skill {
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid #3a321e;
    padding: 23px 12px;
    text-align: center;
    border-radius: 10px;
}

.skill strong {
    display: block;
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 19px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
}

.contact {
    text-align: center;
}

footer {
    padding: 25px 15px;
    text-align: center;
    background: #101010;
    color: #aaa;
    border-top: 1px solid #55451b;
    font-size: 13px;
}

@media(max-width: 600px) {
    header {
        justify-content: center;
        text-align: center;
    }

    nav {
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 12px;
    }

    .hero {
        min-height: 75vh;
    }
}
</style></head><body><header>
    <div class="logo">ARAVIND.</div><nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
    <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
    <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
    <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

</header><main><div class="hero" id="home">

    <div class="badge">
        ✦ MY SOFTWARE ENGINEERING JOURNEY ✦
    </div>

    <img src="aravind.jpg"
     alt="Aravind - Future Software Engineer"
     class="profile-photo">

<h1>Hi, I'm <span>Aravind</span></h1>

    <h2>A Future Software Engineer 💻</h2>

    <p>
        I'm learning to turn creative ideas into
        useful digital experiences. My journey starts
        with code, curiosity and a dream to build
        something extraordinary.
    </p>

    <div>
        <a class="button" href="#projects">
            Explore My Projects
        </a>

        <a class="button secondary" href="#about">
            Discover My Journey
        </a>
    </div>

</div>

<section id="about">
    <h2>About Me</h2>

    <div class="card">
        <h3>My Story</h3>

        <p>
            Welcome to my portfolio! I'm Aravind,
            an aspiring software engineer passionate
            about programming, website development
            and technology.

            I'm building my skills step by step,
            practising coding and creating projects
            to prepare for a career in software
            engineering.
        </p>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="skills">
    <h2>My Learning Path</h2>

    <div class="skills">
        <div class="skill">
            <strong>HTML</strong>
            Website Structure
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <strong>CSS</strong>
            Website Design
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <strong>JavaScript</strong>
            Interactive Websites
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <strong>Python</strong>
            Programming Basics
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <strong>Git</strong>
            Version Control
        </div>

        <div class="skill">
            <strong>Problem Solving</strong>
            Logical Thinking
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="projects">
    <h2>My Projects</h2>

    <div class="projects">
        <div class="card">
            <h3>🌐 Portfolio Website</h3>
            <p>
                My personal website, designed
                with a black and gold theme.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🧮 Calculator</h3>
            <p>
                A beginner project for practising
                programming logic.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
            <h3>🎮 Game Development</h3>
            <p>
                A future project exploring
                interactive game design.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section id="contact">
    <h2>Contact</h2>

    <div class="card contact">
        <h3>Let's Connect</h3>

        <p>
            Want to collaborate or discuss technology?
            Add your professional email address here.
        </p>

        <a class="button"
           href="mailto:your-email@example.com">
            Email Me
        </a>
    </div>
</section>

</main><footer>
    <p>© 2026 Aravind Portfolio</p>
    <p>Learn. Build. Improve. Repeat.</p>
</footer></body>
</html>
